# Detection 4: Rare domain contacted by only one endpoint
# Detects non-standard domains that are not commonly seen in the environment.
# Why it matters: DNS tunneling frequently uses unusual or controlled domains.
# Fields required: _time, host, parent_domain, src_ip, query_count
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1071.004
# Analyst triage: verify if the parent domain is internal or sensitive and if the traffic is isolated to one host.

index=dns_analytics
| stats count AS query_count BY host, parent_domain, src_ip
| where query_count > 50
| sort - query_count
